window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n963\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρωστις</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, genitivos -ιδος e -εως: grama-de-seda ou capim-pé-de-galinha (Cynodon dactylon), descrito em Homero, Teofrasto e Dioscórides. Em outros contextos, Hordeum m</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n964\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρωστήρ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: equivalente a ἀγρώστης, camponês ou caçador; variantes ἀγρώστωρ; Sófocles, Nicandro.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n965\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρώτηρ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, feminino ἀγρώτειρα: camponês ou camponesa, equivalente a ἀγρότης; Estêvão de Bizâncio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n966\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρώτης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino/adjetivo: do campo, silvestre, de feras selvagens; Eurípides, Bacantes e Reso.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n967\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγυια</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino. I. Rua, via, caminho público, sobretudo no plural; ruas da cidade ou caminhos do mar; Homero, Píndaro, tragédia, comédia. II. Conjunto de ruas, cidade. Uso </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n968\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυιαῖος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -α, -ον: provido de ruas ou estradas, atravessado por caminhos; de território, Sófocles, fragmento 202.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n969\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυιάτης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino. I. Equivalente a Ἀγυιεύς, epíteto de Apolo guardião das ruas; vocativo Ἀγυιᾶτα em Ésquilo. II. No plural, moradores de rua/bairro, habitantes de uma via ou</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n970\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυιᾶτις</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ιδος. I. Vizinha, moradora próxima; Píndaro, Píticas 11.1. II. Adjetivo plural feminino em θεραπεῖαι ἀγυιᾶτιδες, culto de Apolo Agieu; Eurípides, </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n971\"><td class=\"greek\">Ἀγυιεύς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Nome masculino de Apolo como guardião das ruas e caminhos; por extensão, coluna pontiaguda colocada junto à entrada da casa como imagem ou altar do deus; Eurípides, Aristófanes e</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n972\"><td class=\"greek\">Ἀγυίηος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Nome masculino elíptico de μήν: Agúeio, mês do calendário de Argos; Mnemosyne 44.221.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n973\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυιόπεζα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Expressão mística ἀγυιόπεζα Κουρῆτις: designação da tríade pitagórica, segundo Nicômaco apud Fócio; não definir sem base ulterior.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n974\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυιοπλαστέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo, de πλάσσω: construir ou moldar em ruas, em fileiras ordenadas; Licófron 601.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n975\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγυιος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον, de ἀ- privativo e γυῖον: sem membros ou débil nos membros, com fraqueza física; Hipócrates, Doenças das mulheres 1.25.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n976\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυμνασία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: falta de exercício ou treino físico, ausência de prática; Aristófanes, Aristóteles. Variante ἀγυμναστία, Porfírio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n977\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγύμναστος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem exercício ou treinamento, não adestrado, de cavalos e pessoas, inclusive mentalmente indisciplinado. II. Inexperiente ou não habituado a algo, com genitivo, </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n978\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγύναιξ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Masculino, de γυνή: sem mulher, sem esposa, solteiro/viúvo conforme contexto; Sófocles. Variantes ἀγύναικος, ἀγύναιος, ἀγύνης, ἄγυνος; LXX Jó 24.21.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n979\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυρεῖ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἀγυρεῖ = συναγκροτεῖ, «reúne, congrega»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n980\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυρίζειν</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa verbal ἀγυρίζειν = συνάγειν, ἀγυρτάζειν, «reunir, recolher, ajuntar»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n981\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγυρις</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, eólico por ἀγορά. I. Reunião, assembleia, multidão, grupo de homens, mortos, navios; Homero, Eurípides, oráculos. II. Coleta ou reunião de ervas, poesia órf</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n982\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυρισμός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: coleta, recolhimento, reunião de objetos; Suda.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n983\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγυρμα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro: aquilo que foi recolhido, produto da coleta, conjunto reunido; glossário AB 327.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n984\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυρμός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: reunião, ajuntamento, assembleia, de animais; equivalente a ἄγυρις ou ἀγερμός, Bábrio, Dionísio de Halicarnasso.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n985\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυρτάζω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: coletar esmolas ou dinheiro mendigando, pedir contribuições; Odisseia 19.284.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n986\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυρτεία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: mendicância, coleta de esmolas; em sentido pejorativo, impostura ou charlatanismo, por vezes ligado a feitiçaria; Temístio, Justiniano.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n987\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγυρτευτής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: coletor de esmolas, mendicante, equivalente a ἀγύρτης; Tzetzes, Histórias.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n963\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n963\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"976\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρωστις\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, genitivos -ιδος e -εως: grama-de-seda ou capim-pé-de-galinha (Cynodon dactylon), descrito em Homero, Teofrasto e Dioscóride\">ἄγρωστις</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, genitivos -ιδος e -εως: grama-de-seda ou capim-pé-de-galinha (Cynodon dactylon), descrito em Homero, Teofrasto e Dioscórides. Em outros contextos, Hordeum marinum na Cilícia e Parnassia palustris no Parnaso; identificações distintas registradas pelo LSJ.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grwstis&quot; orig_id=&quot;n963&quot; key=&quot;a)/grwstis&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρ-ωστις&quot;&gt;ἄγρωστις&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ιδος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0093,001:1:6:10&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HP&lt;/title&gt; 1.6.10&lt;/bibl&gt;, and &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;εως&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,014:552a:15&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HA&lt;/title&gt; 552a15&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Tebt.:104:26&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PTeb.&lt;/title&gt; 104.26&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, acc. &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγρωστιν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:34:10:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 34.10.3&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0099,001:4:1:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Str.&lt;/author&gt; 4.1.7&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;sense id=&quot;n963.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;dogʼs-tooth grass, Cynodon Dactylon,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. μελιηδής&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:6:90&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 6.90&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἱλιτενὴς ἄ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:13:42&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 13.42&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0679,001:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aeschrio&lt;/author&gt; 6&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0060,001:1:43&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.S.&lt;/author&gt; 1.43&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.29. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n963.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. ἐν Κιλικίᾳ&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;Hordeum marinum,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.32; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. ἐν Παρνασσῷ&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;grass of Parnassus, Parnassia palustris,&lt;/i&gt; ib. 31.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n964\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n964\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"977\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρωστήρ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: equivalente a ἀγρώστης, camponês ou caçador; variantes ἀγρώστωρ; Sófocles, Nicandro.\">ἀγρωστήρ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: equivalente a ἀγρώστης, camponês ou caçador; variantes ἀγρώστωρ; Sófocles, Nicandro.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grwsth/r&quot; orig_id=&quot;n964&quot; key=&quot;a)grwsth/r&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ωστήρ&quot;&gt;ἀγρωστήρ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ῆρος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n964.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= -ώστης, &lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ichn.&lt;/title&gt; 33:—also &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρ-ώστωρ&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ορος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0022,002:473&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nic.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Al.&lt;/title&gt; 473&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n965\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n965\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"978\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρώτηρ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, feminino ἀγρώτειρα: camponês ou camponesa, equivalente a ἀγρότης; Estêvão de Bizâncio.\">ἀγρώτηρ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino, feminino ἀγρώτειρα: camponês ou camponesa, equivalente a ἀγρότης; Estêvão de Bizâncio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grw/thr&quot; orig_id=&quot;n965&quot; key=&quot;a)grw/thr&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ώτηρ&quot;&gt;ἀγρώτηρ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, fem. &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρώτειρα&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n965.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀγρότης, St. Byz. s.v. ἀγρός.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n966\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n966\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"979\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρώτης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino/adjetivo: do campo, silvestre, de feras selvagens; Eurípides, Bacantes e Reso.\">ἀγρώτης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino/adjetivo: do campo, silvestre, de feras selvagens; Eurípides, Bacantes e Reso.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grw/ths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n966&quot; key=&quot;a)grw/ths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ώτης&quot;&gt;ἀγρώτης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n966.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;of the field, wild,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;θῆρες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:564&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 564&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (lyr.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,052:266&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 266&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n967\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n967\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"980\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγυια\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino. I. Rua, via, caminho público, sobretudo no plural; ruas da cidade ou caminhos do mar; Homero, Píndaro, tragédia, comédia. I\">ἄγυια</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino. I. Rua, via, caminho público, sobretudo no plural; ruas da cidade ou caminhos do mar; Homero, Píndaro, tragédia, comédia. II. Conjunto de ruas, cidade. Uso em documentos notariais realizados publicamente na rua. Registra variantes de acentuação e flexão épica, consideradas na fonte.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/guia&quot; orig_id=&quot;n967&quot; key=&quot;a)/guia&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγ-υια&quot;&gt;ἄγυια&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾶς&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n967.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;street, highway,&lt;/i&gt; chiefly in pl., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:5:642&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 5.642&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;σκιόωντό τε πᾶσαι ἀ&lt;/foreign&gt;. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:2:388&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 2.388&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; of the paths of the sea, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:11:12&quot;&gt;11.12&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγυιαῖς&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;in the streets,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,003:14:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epigr.&lt;/title&gt; 14.5&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:2:58&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 2.58&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0199,001:3:16&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;B.&lt;/author&gt; 3.16&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,007:715&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OC&lt;/title&gt; 715&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,002:1136&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ant.&lt;/title&gt; 1136&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:87&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 87&lt;/bibl&gt; (all lyr.): esp. in the phrase &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κνισᾶν ἀγυιάς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,002:1320&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.&lt;/title&gt; 1320&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,006:1233&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Av.&lt;/title&gt; 1233&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,021:51&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 21.51&lt;/bibl&gt;:—rare in Prose, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:2:4:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 2.4.3&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Petr.:3p.7&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PPetr.&lt;/title&gt; 3 p.7&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(iii B.C.)&lt;/date&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,025:1:20&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;3 Ma.&lt;/title&gt; 1.20&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν ἀγυιᾷ,&lt;/foreign&gt; of documents executed &lt;i&gt;in public&lt;/i&gt; by a notary, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Oxy.:722:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;POxy.&lt;/title&gt; 722.12&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(i A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;, etc. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n967.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;collection of streets, city,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,001:9:34&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;O.&lt;/title&gt; 9.34&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,003:7:92&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;N.&lt;/title&gt; 7.92&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πολύπυρος ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hymn.Is.&lt;/title&gt; 2&lt;/cit&gt;. (Quasi-participial form from &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγω,&lt;/foreign&gt; cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἅρπυια.&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt; [ἄγυιᾰν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:20:254&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 20.254&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Aristarch.&lt;/author&gt;), cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,003:7:92&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;N.&lt;/title&gt; 7.92&lt;/bibl&gt; codd. vett.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγυια&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ion.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; and old &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Att.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; acc. to &lt;author&gt;Hdn.&lt;/author&gt; Gr. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0015,001:2:613&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;2.613&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4083,001:1631:29&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Eust.&lt;/author&gt; 1631.29&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγυιά,&lt;/foreign&gt; incorrectly, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4099,001:14:21&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;EM&lt;/title&gt; 14.21&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγυιάν&lt;/foreign&gt; freq. in codd., e.g. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,001:9:34&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;O.&lt;/title&gt; 9.34&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; l.c.]&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n968\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n968\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"981\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυιαῖος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -α, -ον: provido de ruas ou estradas, atravessado por caminhos; de território, Sófocles, fragmento 202.\">ἀγυιαῖος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -α, -ον: provido de ruas ou estradas, atravessado por caminhos; de território, Sófocles, fragmento 202.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)guiai=os&quot; orig_id=&quot;n968&quot; key=&quot;a)guiai=os&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγ-υιαῖος&quot;&gt;ἀγυιαῖος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;α&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n968.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;with streets&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;highways,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γῆ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:202&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 202&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n969\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n969\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"982\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυιάτης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino. I. Equivalente a Ἀγυιεύς, epíteto de Apolo guardião das ruas; vocativo Ἀγυιᾶτα em Ésquilo. II. No plural, moradores de rua\">ἀγυιάτης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino. I. Equivalente a Ἀγυιεύς, epíteto de Apolo guardião das ruas; vocativo Ἀγυιᾶτα em Ésquilo. II. No plural, moradores de rua/bairro, habitantes de uma via ou aldeia; inscrições.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)guia/ths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n969&quot; key=&quot;a)guia/ths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγ-υιάτης&quot;&gt;ἀγυιάτης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n969.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= Ἀγυιεύς, voc. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἀγυιᾶτα,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:1081&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 1081&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n969.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; in pl., &lt;i&gt;inhabitants of an &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγυια,&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 9(2).241 (Phars.), cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγυιῆται· κωμῆται,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;title&gt;EM&lt;/title&gt; 15.31.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n970\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n970\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"983\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυιᾶτις\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ιδος. I. Vizinha, moradora próxima; Píndaro, Píticas 11.1. II. Adjetivo plural feminino em θεραπεῖαι ἀγυιᾶτιδες, \">ἀγυιᾶτις</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ιδος. I. Vizinha, moradora próxima; Píndaro, Píticas 11.1. II. Adjetivo plural feminino em θεραπεῖαι ἀγυιᾶτιδες, culto de Apolo Agieu; Eurípides, Íon 186.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)guia=tis&quot; orig_id=&quot;n970&quot; key=&quot;a)guia=tis&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγ-υιᾶτις&quot;&gt;ἀγυιᾶτις&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ιδος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, fem. from foreg., &lt;sense id=&quot;n970.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;neighbour,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:11:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 11.1&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n970.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-άτιδες, θεραπεῖαι&lt;/foreign&gt; worship &lt;i&gt;of Apollo Agyieus,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,010:186&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 186&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n971\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n971\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"984\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"Ἀγυιεύς\" data-meanings=\"Nome masculino de Apolo como guardião das ruas e caminhos; por extensão, coluna pontiaguda colocada junto à entrada da casa como imagem ou altar \">Ἀγυιεύς</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Nome masculino de Apolo como guardião das ruas e caminhos; por extensão, coluna pontiaguda colocada junto à entrada da casa como imagem ou altar do deus; Eurípides, Aristófanes e inscrições.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;cross*)aguieu/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n971&quot; key=&quot;*)aguieu/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;Ἀγυι-εύς&quot;&gt;Ἀγυιεύς&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;έως&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n971.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;a name of Apollo, as &lt;i&gt;guardian of the streets and highways,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,015:631&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 631&lt;/bibl&gt;, Orac. ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,021:52&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 21.52&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 3.159, al. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n971.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;pointed pillar, set up as his statue&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;altar&lt;/i&gt; at the street-door, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,004:875&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;V.&lt;/title&gt; 875&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0486,001:87&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pherecr.&lt;/author&gt; 87&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1313,001:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Dieuchid.&lt;/author&gt; 2&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἀγυιεὺς βωμός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:370&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 370&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n972\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n972\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"985\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"Ἀγυίηος\" data-meanings=\"Nome masculino elíptico de μήν: Agúeio, mês do calendário de Argos; Mnemosyne 44.221.\">Ἀγυίηος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Nome masculino elíptico de μήν: Agúeio, mês do calendário de Argos; Mnemosyne 44.221.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;cross*)agui/hos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n972&quot; key=&quot;*)agui/hos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;Ἀγυί-ηος&quot;&gt;Ἀγυίηος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, sc. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μήν,&lt;/foreign&gt; name of month at Argos, &lt;title&gt;Mnemos.&lt;/title&gt; 44.221 &lt;date&gt;(iii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n973\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n973\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"986\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυιόπεζα\" data-meanings=\"Expressão mística ἀγυιόπεζα Κουρῆτις: designação da tríade pitagórica, segundo Nicômaco apud Fócio; não definir sem base ulterior.\">ἀγυιόπεζα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Expressão mística ἀγυιόπεζα Κουρῆτις: designação da tríade pitagórica, segundo Nicômaco apud Fócio; não definir sem base ulterior.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)guio/peza&quot; orig_id=&quot;n973&quot; key=&quot;a)guio/peza&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγυιό-πεζα&quot;&gt;ἀγυιόπεζα&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Κουρῆτις,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, mystical name for Pythagorean triad, &lt;author&gt;Nicom.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4040,001:143B&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Phot.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Bibl.&lt;/title&gt; 143B.&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n974\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n974\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"987\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυιοπλαστέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo, de πλάσσω: construir ou moldar em ruas, em fileiras ordenadas; Licófron 601.\">ἀγυιοπλαστέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo, de πλάσσω: construir ou moldar em ruas, em fileiras ordenadas; Licófron 601.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)guioplaste/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n974&quot; key=&quot;a)guioplaste/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγυιο-πλαστέω&quot;&gt;ἀγυιοπλαστέω&lt;/head&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;πλάσσω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n974.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;to build in streets&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;rows,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0341,002:601&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lyc.&lt;/author&gt; 601&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n975\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n975\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"988\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγυιος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον, de ἀ- privativo e γυῖον: sem membros ou débil nos membros, com fraqueza física; Hipócrates, Doenças das mulheres 1.25.\">ἄγυιος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον, de ἀ- privativo e γυῖον: sem membros ou débil nos membros, com fraqueza física; Hipócrates, Doenças das mulheres 1.25.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/guios&quot; orig_id=&quot;n975&quot; key=&quot;a)/guios&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγυιος&quot;&gt;ἄγυιος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n975.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;without limbs, weak in limb,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,036:1:25&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mul.&lt;/title&gt; 1.25&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n976\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n976\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"989\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυμνασία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: falta de exercício ou treino físico, ausência de prática; Aristófanes, Aristóteles. Variante ἀγυμναστία, Porfírio.\">ἀγυμνασία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: falta de exercício ou treino físico, ausência de prática; Aristófanes, Aristóteles. Variante ἀγυμναστία, Porfírio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gumna^si/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n976&quot; key=&quot;a)gumna^si/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγυμν-ᾰσία&quot;&gt;ἀγυμνασία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;γυμνάζω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n976.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;want of exercise&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;training,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,009:1088&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ra.&lt;/title&gt; 1088&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,010:1114a:24&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;EN&lt;/title&gt; 1114a24&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγυμν-αστία&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, = foreg., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2034,003:1:35&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Porph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Abst.&lt;/title&gt; 1.35&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n977\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n977\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"990\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγύμναστος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem exercício ou treinamento, não adestrado, de cavalos e pessoas, inclusive mentalmente indisciplinado. II. Inexperiente ou não\">ἀγύμναστος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem exercício ou treinamento, não adestrado, de cavalos e pessoas, inclusive mentalmente indisciplinado. II. Inexperiente ou não habituado a algo, com genitivo, εἰς, πρός, περί ou infinitivo; Platão, Eurípides. III. Não atormentado nem submetido a esforços, com valor negativo; Sófocles. Advérbio ἀγυμνάστως.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gu/mnastos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n977&quot; key=&quot;a)gu/mnastos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγύμν-αστος&quot;&gt;ἀγύμναστος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n977.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unexercised, untrained,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἵπποι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:8:1:38&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 8.1.38&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:888a:23&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 888a23&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τοῖς σώμασιν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,063:47&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Arat.&lt;/title&gt; 47&lt;/bibl&gt;: metaph., &lt;i&gt;undisciplined,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φαντασίαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Stoic.&lt;/title&gt; 2.39&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n977.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;unpractised,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τινός&lt;/foreign&gt; in a thing, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:491&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 491&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:1:6:29&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 1.6.29&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt;, etc.; also &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἴς&lt;/foreign&gt; or &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρός τι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:731b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 731b&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:816a&quot;&gt;816a&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περί τι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,118:802:d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Praec.&lt;/title&gt; 2.802d&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 8.608; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν λόγοις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1.189&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt;: c. &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;inf.&lt;/mood&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Muson.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 6 p.23 H. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n977.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;unharassed,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:1083&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 1083&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐδʼ ἀγύμναστον πλάνοις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,014:533&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hel.&lt;/title&gt; 533&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πόνοις οὐκ ἀγύμναστος φρένας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,020:344&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 344&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n977.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγυμνάστως, ἔχειν πρός τι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:2:1:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mem.&lt;/title&gt; 2.1.6&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n978\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n978\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"991\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγύναιξ\" data-meanings=\"Masculino, de γυνή: sem mulher, sem esposa, solteiro/viúvo conforme contexto; Sófocles. Variantes ἀγύναικος, ἀγύναιος, ἀγύνης, ἄγυνος; LXX Jó 24.\">ἀγύναιξ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Masculino, de γυνή: sem mulher, sem esposa, solteiro/viúvo conforme contexto; Sófocles. Variantes ἀγύναικος, ἀγύναιος, ἀγύνης, ἄγυνος; LXX Jó 24.21.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gu/naic&quot; orig_id=&quot;n978&quot; key=&quot;a)gu/naic&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγύναιξ&quot;&gt;ἀγύναιξ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;γυνή&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n978.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;wifeless,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 4&lt;/bibl&gt;:—also &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγύναικος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0496,001:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Phryn.Com.&lt;/author&gt; 19&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγύναιος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,032:24:21&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Jb.&lt;/title&gt; 24.21&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,BGU:volume=5:document=1210:79&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PGnom.&lt;/title&gt; 79&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0385,001:56:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.C.&lt;/author&gt; 56.1&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2034,003:4:17&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Porph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Abst.&lt;/title&gt; 4.17&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2583,001:1:173&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Man.&lt;/author&gt; 1.173&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγύνης&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0542,001:3:48&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Poll.&lt;/author&gt; 3.48&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄγυνος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,012:735&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 735&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n979\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n979\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"992\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυρεῖ\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἀγυρεῖ = συναγκροτεῖ, «reúne, congrega»; Hesíquio.\">ἀγυρεῖ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa ἀγυρεῖ = συναγκροτεῖ, «reúne, congrega»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gurei=&quot; orig_id=&quot;n979&quot; key=&quot;a)gurei=&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγυρ-εῖ·&quot;&gt;ἀγυρεῖ&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;συναγκροτεῖ,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n980\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n980\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"993\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυρίζειν\" data-meanings=\"Glosa verbal ἀγυρίζειν = συνάγειν, ἀγυρτάζειν, «reunir, recolher, ajuntar»; Hesíquio.\">ἀγυρίζειν</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa verbal ἀγυρίζειν = συνάγειν, ἀγυρτάζειν, «reunir, recolher, ajuntar»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)guri/zein&quot; orig_id=&quot;n980&quot; key=&quot;a)guri/zein&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγυρ-ίζειν·&quot;&gt;ἀγυρίζειν&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;συνάγειν, ἀγυρτάζειν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n981\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n981\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"994\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγυρις\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, eólico por ἀγορά. I. Reunião, assembleia, multidão, grupo de homens, mortos, navios; Homero, Eurípides, oráculos. II. Colet\">ἄγυρις</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, eólico por ἀγορά. I. Reunião, assembleia, multidão, grupo de homens, mortos, navios; Homero, Eurípides, oráculos. II. Coleta ou reunião de ervas, poesia órfica.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gu^ris&quot; orig_id=&quot;n981&quot; key=&quot;a)/gu^ris&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγῠρ-ις&quot;&gt;ἄγυρις&lt;/head&gt; &lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;[ᾰ]&lt;/pron&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ιος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n981.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Aeol.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγορά,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;gathering, crowd,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀνδρῶν ἄγυριν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:3:31&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 3.31&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; ; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν νεκύων ἀγύρει&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:16:661&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 16.661&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; ; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν νηῶν ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:24:141&quot;&gt;24.141&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; also in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,018:753&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;IA&lt;/title&gt; 753&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.); &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;παμπληθὴς ἄ.&lt;/foreign&gt; Orac. ap. &lt;author&gt;Phleg.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Macr.&lt;/title&gt; 4. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n981.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;gathering&lt;/i&gt; of herbs, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0579,003:416&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Orph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;L.&lt;/title&gt; 416&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n982\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n982\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"995\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυρισμός\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: coleta, recolhimento, reunião de objetos; Suda.\">ἀγυρισμός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: coleta, recolhimento, reunião de objetos; Suda.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gu^rismo/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n982&quot; key=&quot;a)gu^rismo/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγῠρ-ισμός&quot;&gt;ἀγυρισμός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n982.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;collection,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Suid.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n983\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n983\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"996\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγυρμα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro: aquilo que foi recolhido, produto da coleta, conjunto reunido; glossário AB 327.\">ἄγυρμα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro: aquilo que foi recolhido, produto da coleta, conjunto reunido; glossário AB 327.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gu^rma&quot; orig_id=&quot;n983&quot; key=&quot;a)/gu^rma&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγῠρ-μα&quot;&gt;ἄγυρμα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ατος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n983.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;anything collected,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;AB&lt;/title&gt; 327.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n984\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n984\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"997\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυρμός\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: reunião, ajuntamento, assembleia, de animais; equivalente a ἄγυρις ou ἀγερμός, Bábrio, Dionísio de Halicarnasso.\">ἀγυρμός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: reunião, ajuntamento, assembleia, de animais; equivalente a ἄγυρις ou ἀγερμός, Bábrio, Dionísio de Halicarnasso.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gu^rmo/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n984&quot; key=&quot;a)gu^rmo/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγῠρ-μός&quot;&gt;ἀγυρμός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n984.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἄγυρις, ἀγρίων ζῴων &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0614,001:102:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Babr.&lt;/author&gt; 102.5&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;title&gt;AB&lt;/title&gt; 331; = ἀγερμός (which is a v.l.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,001:2:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; 2.19&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4099,001:8:7&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;EM&lt;/title&gt; 8.7&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n985\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n985\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"998\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυρτάζω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: coletar esmolas ou dinheiro mendigando, pedir contribuições; Odisseia 19.284.\">ἀγυρτάζω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: coletar esmolas ou dinheiro mendigando, pedir contribuições; Odisseia 19.284.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gu^rta/zw&quot; orig_id=&quot;n985&quot; key=&quot;a)gu^rta/zw&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγῠρ-τάζω&quot;&gt;ἀγυρτάζω&lt;/head&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγύρτης&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n985.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;collect by begging,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;χρήματα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:19:284&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 19.284&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n986\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n986\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"999\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυρτεία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: mendicância, coleta de esmolas; em sentido pejorativo, impostura ou charlatanismo, por vezes ligado a feitiçaria; Temístio,\">ἀγυρτεία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: mendicância, coleta de esmolas; em sentido pejorativo, impostura ou charlatanismo, por vezes ligado a feitiçaria; Temístio, Justiniano.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gu^rtei/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n986&quot; key=&quot;a)gu^rtei/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγῠρ-τεία&quot;&gt;ἀγυρτεία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n986.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;begging, imposture,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2001,005:70b&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Them.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 5.70b&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μαγγανεῖαι καὶ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2734,013:22:15&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Just.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Nov.&lt;/title&gt; 22.15&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n987\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n987\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1000\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγυρτευτής\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: coletor de esmolas, mendicante, equivalente a ἀγύρτης; Tzetzes, Histórias.\">ἀγυρτευτής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: coletor de esmolas, mendicante, equivalente a ἀγύρτης; Tzetzes, Histórias.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte original integral TEI para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gu^rteuth/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n987&quot; key=&quot;a)gu^rteuth/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγῠρ-τευτής&quot;&gt;ἀγυρτευτής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;οῦ&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n987.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀγύρτης, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,9022,001:13c&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Tz.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 13c&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,9022,001:475&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;475&lt;/bibl&gt; tit.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>";
